	<Table Name="Standard" Type="TechUpgradeTable">
		<!-- Only YapYap research commands. Column 2 is an ownership/count gate, NOT the researcher; BidCreateTech chooses the actual building. The King Temple upgrade is the Covenant's reactor upgrade and waits for a tank core; the followers techs are the Covenant population upgrades and their gates are scaled to the 28 Grunt Tank target. Base upgrades belong exclusively to the multibase manager. Factory, barracks and Temple tier upgrades are deliberately absent: they transform the building and would break its build-list count, exactly as the vehicle depot and barracks upgrades are left out of the UNSC tables. No campaign grants, unrelated leaders or duplicate rows. -->
